   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Training",
   "texto": [
    "It is formed with **nous** from the present, removing **-ons** and adding **-ant**: **nous parlons** → **parlant**, **nous finissons** → **finissant**.",
    "Unregular: **être** → **étant**, **avoir** → **ayant**, **faire** → **faisant**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Use",
   "texto": [
    "It is used with **en** in front of: **en travaillant** (working while working). He says two actions happen at once or how to do something: **Je travaille en écoutant de la musique** (I work listening to music)."
   ]
  },
